<p><em>97 Things Every Cloud Engineer Should Know</em> brings together wisdom from dozens of experienced cloud practitioners in short, digestible essays. Lee Atchison contributed to this collection, sharing practical insights drawn from years of building and operating large-scale cloud systems.</p>

